  "ppLastUpdated": "Last updated: March 1, 2026",
  "ppHighlightBanner": "Your health data is encrypted end-to-end and never shared without consent.",
  "ppContactFooter": "Questions? Contact privacy@dastern.com",
  "ppSection1Title": "Information We Collect",
  "ppSection1Body": "We collect personal information you provide (name, email, health data) and automatically gathered data (device info, usage patterns) to deliver and improve our services.",
  "ppSection2Title": "Health Data",
  "ppSection2Body": "Medication records, vital signs, and health notes are stored securely. We never sell health data. Access is limited to you, your care team (with your consent), and authorized staff for service delivery.",
  "ppSection3Title": "Data Security",
  "ppSection3Body": "We use industry-standard encryption (AES-256) for data at rest and TLS 1.3 for data in transit. Access is controlled with role-based permissions and regular security audits.",
  "ppSection4Title": "Sharing & Disclosure",
  "ppSection4Body": "We do not sell your data. We may share information with healthcare providers you authorize, service partners under strict agreements, or when required by law.",
  "ppSection5Title": "Cookies & Analytics",
  "ppSection5Body": "We use minimal analytics to understand app usage and improve features. No third-party advertising trackers are used in DasTern.",
  "ppSection6Title": "Your Rights",
  "ppSection6Body": "You can access, correct, export, or delete your personal data at any time from your profile settings. You may also withdraw consent for optional data processing.",
  "ppSection7Title": "Policy Changes",
  "ppSection7Body": "We will notify you of significant changes via in-app notification or email. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.",

